[TITLE]
Slot program fixture (c): fill - pressurize - drain - refill cycling.
The downstream stage boundary oscillates above and below the crown
(115 ft vs 100.5 ft on a 3 ft pipe at invert 100), so the barrel is driven
across the pressurization transition twice per 2 h regardless of inflow.
Network-level hysteresis probe: the second pressurized visit must land on
the first (memoryless closure); slot storage must return to zero on drain.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         FV
START_DATE           01/01/2026
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2026
END_TIME             04:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:01:00
ROUTING_STEP         0.5
FV_SLOT_CELERITY     100
LENGTHENING_STEP     0

[JUNCTIONS]
J0     100.0 40.0 0 0 0

[OUTFALLS]
OF     100.0 TIMESERIES CycleStage NO

[CONDUITS]
C1     J0   OF 300 0.013 0 0 0

[XSECTIONS]
C1     CIRCULAR 3 0 0 0 1

[INFLOWS]
J0     FLOW "" FLOW 1.0 1.0 2.0

[TIMESERIES]
;;pressurized 0-1h, drained 1-2h, pressurized 2-3h, drained 3-4h
CycleStage 0:00 115.0
CycleStage 0:59 115.0
CycleStage 1:00 100.5
CycleStage 1:59 100.5
CycleStage 2:00 115.0
CycleStage 2:59 115.0
CycleStage 3:00 100.5

[REPORT]
CONTINUITY YES
FLOWSTATS YES
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
